<metadata><name>Volcano View from Highway 35 (Road 44, Road 4410)</name><desc>or-vielbig-2e:213-2: route read from the book's text and sketch map. One trkseg per waypoint pair, in order; segment sources are in the trk desc. Geometry from OSM (ODbL, (c) OpenStreetMap contributors) and USFS EDW (public domain) where marked; 'straight' segments are off-trail connectors, not traced.</desc></metadata>
<wpt lat="45.373973" lon="-121.566853"><ele>1008.3</ele><name>Highway 35 at Road 44</name><desc>source: DB trailhead pin th:hwy35-road-44 (OSM node 33436785); confidence: high; pdf_page: 214; book_elev_ft: 3280; quote: All tours in this area are reached by skiing (or driving) uphill on Road 44 from Highway 35 ... (3,280 feet)</desc></wpt>
<wpt lat="45.408084" lon="-121.546922"><ele>1306.3</ele><name>Road 44 / Road 4410 junction, 200 yd past Clinger Spring</name><desc>source: OSM node 33426868, as in or-vielbig-2e_215-1 and 218-1; confidence: high; pdf_page: 215; book_elev_ft: 4200; quote: Ski past Clinger Spring about 200 yards and turn right (uphill) onto Road 4410, the Lookout Mountain road.</desc></wpt>
<wpt lat="45.400988" lon="-121.543725"><ele>1390.3</ele><name>Level junction, Road 4410 / Road 4410-130</name><desc>source: OSM node 33435140, 0.79 mi up Lookout Mountain Road (4410) from Road 44, past side roads 4410-660 and 4410-120; DEM 4,561 ft; 4410 turns back south-west here; confidence: high; pdf_page: 215; quote: Ski upward past the first side road, then follow a wide, obvious turn to the east to arrive at a level junction at 0.8 mile. The Lookout Mountain road cuts back at a reverse angle</desc></wpt>
<wpt lat="45.402033" lon="-121.535913"><ele>1407.0</ele><name>Volcano View</name><desc>source: OSM node 33425449, the bend at the north-pointing nose of Road 4410-130, 0.42 mi east of the level junction; DEM 4,616 ft; confidence: medium; pdf_page: 215; book_elev_ft: 4600; quote: For the best views, however, ski east from the level junction for 0.4 mile to the viewpoint. ... From the viewpoint, 1.4 miles from Clinger Spring</desc></wpt>
<trk><name>Volcano View from Highway 35 (Road 44, Road 4410)</name><desc>1. Highway 35 at Road 44 -&gt; Road 44 / Road 4410 junction, 200 yd past Clinger Spring: osm (high), 3.78 mi | 2. Road 44 / Road 4410 junction, 200 yd past Clinger Spring -&gt; Level junction, Road 4410 / Road 4410-130: osm (high), 0.79 mi | 3. Level junction, Road 4410 / Road 4410-130 -&gt; Volcano View: osm (high), 0.42 mi</desc>
